++- [x] EndpointMapper module — verified (v0.2.0, emits Finding on discovery)
++- [x] BrainGenerator — implemented and wired to runner shutdown
++- [x] mitmproxy integration — proxy/core/proxy.py + runner.py
++- [x] 16 tests passing (pytest tests/ -v)
++- [x] VirtualBox VM deployment — 192.168.50.221, DHCP reserved
++- [x] CA cert distributed — TLS interception working
++- [ ] PassiveScanner module — not started
++- [ ] FindingReporter module — not started
